Scenario: A parent with no configured environment delegates an API migration, queues a note while the worker is idle, and follows up after idle eviction. The worker temporarily attaches a workspace, then resumes with no environment, its earlier answer, and the unread note. Complete model streams are grouped as parent, then worker.

